


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_c077e2c0:


    "放学后。女生们聚集在文的座位周围。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b54aba94:


    "伦和圣夜子在稍远的位子上看着。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_d9dcc41e:



    voice "2HI_0425"
    hina "「嗯，那是啥？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_7f7f91c9:


    "此时从职员室回来的阳菜也加入了进来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_6e91f754:



    voice "2RI_0458"
    rin "「情人节巧克力菜谱讲习会」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_f909fc50:



    voice "2HI_0426"
    hina "「啊啊，原来如此」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_533bdb58:


    "阳菜马上就理解了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_015916aa:



    voice "2RI_0459"
    rin "「大家都知道文的老家是西点屋，父亲是甜点师，本人也很擅长做菜，当然会有来听课的学生」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_e981de9c:



    voice "2HI_0427"
    hina "「哈哈，似乎可以收学费了。话说你们还真是心急啊。这不才一月吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_e433e580:



    voice "2RI_0460"
    rin "「嗯，这种活动，最开心的还是过程啦……大概」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_2001a0f3:



    voice "2HI_0428"
    hina "「哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_2269b5d9:


    "情人节的前哨战。明明是女校？不，这可是女校独有的风景。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_5746a586:



    voice "2RI_0461"
    rin "「话说，有点慢啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_0c205110:



    voice "2HI_0429"
    hina "「啊，嗯。被人拜托收拾在大教室里用的麦克风了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_8ef9b6b4:



    voice "2RI_0462"
    rin "「嗯？上完课之后没有放回柜子里吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_cdb25061:



    voice "2HI_0430"
    hina "「不，其实，大教室的麦克风有点问题，所以我就赶忙去拿来了广播室的备用品」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_e8187e06:



    voice "2RI_0463"
    rin "「啊，所以你才去还了吗。于是你是去了广播室？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_1b04088a:



    voice "2HI_0431"
    hina "「不，还没……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_823e3fb8:


    "含糊不清，暧昧不明的回答。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_96633e9e:



    voice "2HI_0432"
    hina "「讲习会结束之后，大家再一起去吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_b5f08953:



    voice "2RI_0464"
    rin "「我倒是无所谓。似乎还得一会儿时间。你去一趟吧——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_72025359:



    voice "2HI_0433"
    hina "「一个人去也太无聊了！你看，不是说出门靠朋友吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_f37ef343:



    voice "2RI_0465"
    rin "「去广播室还个东西就算出门么……啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_01349437:


    "伦好像想到了什么。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_1cf09f87:



    voice "2RI_0466"
    rin "「啊，据说广播室里有幽灵哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_5f30f014:



    voice "2HI_0434"
    hina "「呜哇，不要说啊～～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_128a8310:



    voice "2RI_0467"
    rin "「广播室有时候会传出似乎是在控诉什么的声音。而且，那声音会通过扩音器传到全校……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_9bd1fa7f:



    voice "2HI_0435"
    hina "「啊啊啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_9ef2a06b:


    "这就是校内广播。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_a712c4db:



    voice "2MI_0305"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_9bb51b27:



    voice "2RI_0468"
    rin "「怎么了，圣夜夜？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_f2913aba:



    voice "2MI_0306"
    miyako "「这个有点让人坐立不安的气氛，我觉得很棒」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_8fe588b3:



    voice "2RI_0469"
    rin "「是，是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_1889bc81:



    voice "2MI_0307"
    miyako "「你不觉得有一股香甜的味道吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_d8b4e5a8:


    "说着圣夜子深深地吸了口气。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_50bf448d:



    voice "2HI_0436"
    hina "「巧克力的味道？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_8f470c2c:



    voice "2RI_0470"
    rin "「不管怎么说那也太早了吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_d258ee25:


    "圣夜子是从情人节前的教室的氛围中感受到了生命的气息吧。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_82bd304e:


    "大概和作为天使观察三人的时候差不多的感觉。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_f807c9ac:



    voice "2RI_0471"
    rin "「顺便一说，有送过或者收到过巧克力吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_0b3453a1:



    voice "2MI_0308"
    miyako "「没有呢～我还是第一次过情人节」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_0d27c8e1:



    voice "2HI_0437"
    hina "「你之前生活在没有情人节的国家里吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_cdab7b2b:



    voice "2RI_0472"
    rin "「沙特阿拉伯之类的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_a0a51de6:



    voice "2HI_0438"
    hina "「啊，是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_e3b0dbe7:



    voice "2RI_0473"
    rin "「还有死刑」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_9a9b6baa:



    voice "2HI_0439"
    hina "「咦咦咦！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_b_05acf793:



    voice "2MI_0309"
    miyako "「嗯？」"




translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_d106fba3:


    "下课后。女生们聚集在文的座位周围。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_805c8e2c:


    "情人节的前哨战。明明是女校？不，这可是女校独有的风景。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_d7ed80af:


    voice "2RI_0467"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_02_a_bf2a6c0e:


    rin "「广播室有时候会传出似乎是在控诉什么的声音。而且，那声音会通过扩音器传到全校……」"
